Package: pack-unpack
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: create and unpack archives via libarchive (pack/unpack)
 Two small CLI tools: pack creates archives; unpack detects format and
 writes members to disk. Implemented in C using libarchive.
 .
 Canonical commands: pack, unpack.
 An optional extract→unpack symlink exists for local installs
 (INSTALL_EXTRACT_ALIAS=1) but is omitted from this package so it does
 not clash with GNU libextractor's extract(1).
